					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td class="body">
							After Mezzmerizor had some trouble in Oasis with Doranaf (RL friend in MA) and Ozium (who is also our Oz in JE) I was glad to see everyone show up from both JE and MA. I spoke with the leader and some senior officers and we have become friends all &lt;Mystery Assitance&gt; members are to be treated like a &lt;Judicial Enforcer&gt; (of course we treat all anti guilds as friends) but this is an official alliance. After the inccident I can see their style is much like our own an anti but aggressive when need be guild! We have made some good friends.
